281
00:14:13,380 --> 00:14:14,210
Hello there!

282
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:17,228
At the very least, I
can keep them hydrated.

283
00:14:17,540 --> 00:14:20,187
Feel free to drink as
much as you like, okay?

284
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,310
Thanks.

285
00:14:21,393 --> 00:14:22,660
I really appreciate it.

286
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,780
Yeah, you're a lifesaver.

287
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:29,628
That was nice of you, Boxo.

288
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,240
Thank you very much!

289
00:14:32,060 --> 00:14:33,917
Thanks for the assistance, Kerioyl.

290
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:37,471
Just the kind of work I expect
from the Menagerie of Fools.

291
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,640
Menagerie of Fools?

292
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,917
That's a weird name for a group.

293
