but evidence is beginning to mount that a

302
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:09,017
King Frog Fiend was born
this breeding season.

303
00:15:09,100 --> 00:15:10,760
A King Frog Fiend?

304
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:11,840
Sounds scary.

305
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:14,577
I really hope we don't
come across that thing.

306
00:15:14,660 --> 00:15:18,280
I hired your team to act as
bodyguards for Lamas and Boxo,

307
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:20,897
but if we really are dealing
with a King Frog Fiend,

308
00:15:20,980 --> 00:15:22,657
that changes things drastically.

309
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:26,280
I'm afraid I have no choice
but to ask for your help. Sure.

310
00:15:26,540 --> 00:15:30,197
A nasty job like this is just
perfect for the Menagerie of Fools.

311
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:31,110
Hmm.

312
00:15:31,193 --> 00:15:32,023
We'll need food.

313
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:34,457
Can I count on the two of you for that?

314
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:36,377
Are you and Boxxo
willing to keep the group

315
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:39,342
supplied while we search
for the King Frog Fiend?

316
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:41,400
That's what Boxxo and I do best.

317
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:49,461
Hey, anyone available to
give me a hand over here?

318
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:52,480
Yeah, I'll be right there. Bye.

319
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:56,557
I gotta leave you alone for a little
while, but don't you cry while I'm gone.

320
00:15:56,640 --> 00:15:58,758
I look forward to serving you again.

321
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,030
Okay,

322
00:16:00,113 --> 00:16:03,237
fine, don't miss me, but I'm going to
remember this the next time you're lonely.

323
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:07,517
That was the kind of conversation a
flesh-and-blood person would have with a lover.

324
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,600
Sadly, I am but a vending machine.

325
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:12,990
