326
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:15,260
Whoa, who's this guy?

327
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:19,857
Hey, hey, hey, are you
trying to steal my money?

328
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:20,770
Hello there.

329
00:16:21,620 --> 00:16:25,914
Listen, if you don't stop making noise,
I'm going to destroy you, got it?

330
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,060
Ah, that's right.

331
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:29,455
Keep them coming, you freak of nature.

332
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:34,360
Why is this so damn hot? Ha-ha-ha!

333
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:38,389
How about some extra hot corn
soup for my favorite customer?

334
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:39,830
You!

335
00:16:39,913 --> 00:16:40,840
You dumb-ass box!

336
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,477
You just made your last mistake!

337
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:43,678
I'm gonna kill you!

338
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:49,540
I'm sorry, am I interrupting something?

339
