345
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:29,522
Okay, let's get you out of here.

346
00:17:31,100 --> 00:17:33,820
Shit, I can't get the Unasusu to go!

347
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,577
We've got to find a way to
