I thought she was going to do that.

352
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:51,877
What do you think you're doing?

353
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,548
Why did you cut them loose?

354
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,341
Cause I'm not too scared to pull!

355
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,660
Are you serious? We're moving!

356
