barrier, but I can't cover the whole wagon.

358
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:12,630
No!

359
00:18:12,713 --> 00:18:15,077
She'd never forgive me if I
saved her and let the others die.

360
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,336
I need another idea!

361
00:18:19,260 --> 00:18:22,848
Do I have anything in my inventory
I can use to slow it down?

362
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:26,040
Come on, there's got to be
something I can do here!

363
00:18:26,820 --> 00:18:28,900
Damn it! Something! Anything!

364
00:18:30,380 --> 00:18:31,210
Wait a minute.

365
00:18:31,540 --> 00:18:32,700
Oh, that's perfect!

366
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:39,580
Thank you very much!

367
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,038
