368
00:18:41,180 --> 00:18:43,797
Oh, wait, are you saying you
have something that can help?

369
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:44,710
Hello there!

370
00:18:45,020 --> 00:18:46,961
I knew you'd come up with a plan!

371
00:18:47,780 --> 00:18:50,477
I don't understand, but
it's better than nothing!

372
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:52,678
Now I just gotta buy a new function.

373
00:18:52,820 --> 00:18:53,680
Form change!

374
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:04,660
Whoa, Voxo, you got all
roundy! Wait a minute.

375
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,941
Why hasn't she complimented
any of my other forms?

376
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:13,411
Okay, so, uh, this thing fits
into the plan somehow, right?

377
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:15,340
