380
00:19:19,580 --> 00:19:21,440
Please insert coins.

381
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,040
Please insert coins.

382
00:19:23,380 --> 00:19:24,597
Please insert coins.

383
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:25,510
What?

384
00:19:25,593 --> 00:19:26,423
You want me to pay you right now?

385
00:19:26,506 --> 00:19:28,157
We don't really have time for that.

386
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,070
Too bad.

387
00:19:29,153 --> 00:19:29,996
Please insert coins.

388
00:19:30,220 --> 00:19:32,137
Please insert coins. I...

389
00:19:32,220 --> 00:19:33,338
I don't understand.

390
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:36,740
I'm so sorry, but I don't
know what else to do.

391
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:40,496
This is too much for a vending
machine to communicate.

392
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:41,760
We gotta move.

393
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:43,980
I think this thing is just busted.

394
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:45,060
Don't say that.

395
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:47,137
He's trying to tell me something.

396
00:19:47,220 --> 00:19:49,691
And whatever it is, I know it's important!

397
00:19:49,980 --> 00:19:53,697
She's putting so much faith in me,
but there's nothing more I can do!

398
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:56,309
Please, Lamas, give up
on the plan and run!

399
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:59,917
So I take these things and
then do something with coins?

400
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:00,830
Is that it?

401
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:05,237
What the hell did I just wake up to?

402
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,537
You guys gotta untie me!

403
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:08,317
There's no way I'm
gonna die here with you!

404
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:09,640
Hurry! Shut up!

405
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:15,680
I'm sorry, you idiot, I'm a good
place of water, hurry, hurry!

406
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,311
Drink this and calm down.

407
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:21,560
I think that's it.

408
00:20:25,820 --> 00:20:26,660
What the hell?

409
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:28,497
