It hurts my eyes!

411
00:20:29,980 --> 00:20:30,940
They got it!

412
00:20:31,100 --> 00:20:33,317
This is a well-known
phenomenon where I come from,

413
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,897
but it's completely unknown to them.

414
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:39,297
If you put a certain minty candy into
cola, the results are shocking to behold.

415
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:40,210
I get it.

416
00:20:40,293 --> 00:20:43,037
