candy into this drink.

417
00:20:43,120 --> 00:20:43,950
Hello there.

418
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,652
You heard him, everyone.

419
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,460
You guys ready?

420
00:20:50,700 --> 00:20:51,940
Yeah, let's do it!

421
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:57,380
Now aim for the eyes and fire!

422
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:02,857
What in the world's going on here?

423
00:21:02,940 --> 00:21:03,770
Hurry, everyone.

424
00:21:03,853 --> 00:21:05,657
We need to help Blomas and Boxxo.

425
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:06,681
