426
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:09,630
Ah!

427
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:17,080
All right, it's finally over!

428
00:21:18,420 --> 00:21:19,420
Thanks, Boxo.

429
00:21:19,540 --> 00:21:20,957
We owe it all to you, buddy.

430
00:21:21,040 --> 00:21:23,158
I look forward to serving you again.

431
00:21:26,140 --> 00:21:28,797
Lamas, when we couldn't find
the wagon at the meeting point,

432
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,197
