to apologize for that.

436
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:39,100
The fault is mine.

437
00:21:39,380 --> 00:21:43,097
But if I had just stayed where you told us
to, then you would have found us easier.

438
00:21:43,180 --> 00:21:44,160
I'm so sorry.

439
00:21:44,520 --> 00:21:48,157
The girl and the bear began to
take turns bowing to each other.

440
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:51,181
It was a surreal yet
strangely heartwarming sight.

441
00:21:51,980 --> 00:21:53,837
Mission accomplished, everybody.

442
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:54,940
Let's go home.

443
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:59,304
But until we reach the village,
this is still an organized march.

444
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:00,539
Stay on your toes.

445
00:22:00,940 --> 00:22:01,780
Yes, sir!

446
00:22:17,140 --> 00:22:19,857
I'll see

447
00:22:19,940 --> 00:22:26,917
you

448
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:27,830
next time

449
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:11,900
If you like me, I'll tell
you when I'm going to come.

450
00:23:18,740 --> 00:23:24,020
When the dawn's early,
let's go to sleep with you.

451
00:23:26,380 --> 00:23:29,204
As long as you can see,
we'll have a good dream.

452
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:39,835
and look forward to serving you again.
